#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/isomorphic-lib-v21/docs/taon-admin/cms.component.html:33
msgid "Storage assets are accessed through Taon storage APIs. For example, the Assets page lists stored files and requests short-lived private URLs rather than buffering file contents in the browser. Configure the storage backend and public/private access policy for the deployment target."
msgstr ""

