msgid "The Angular backoffice runs in the browser. Its context and data APIs must be registered on the application's Taon backend. WebSQL mode places backend work in the browser, so it is not a substitute for a server when the application needs server-managed credentials or externally reachable media URLs. Check the selected storage provider's support before enabling CMS uploads in WebSQL or a Cloudflare Worker."
